<title>JAPAN: Dainichiseika - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Dainichiseika - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 59.40		vs	   59.75</p>
<p> Operating	    1.65		vs	    1.23</p>
<p> Current		1.82		vs	    1.48</p>
<p> Net		  802    million    vs	  760    million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.80 yen	  vs	    8.45 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     91 million	  vs	  90 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Dainichiseika Colour &amp; Chemicals Mfg Co is a producer of pigments and colouring agents for synthetic resins and fibres.</p>
